    targetItemId:
    targetNpcId:
    targetAreaId:
  - id: node_closing_casual
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: node_complete
    objectiveIdToComplete:
    speakerName: Morita
    speakerId: npc_teacher_morita
    textJa: 「よろしく」は友だちに言います。先生やクラスには「よろしくお願いします」と言いましょう。
    textReading: 「よろしく」はともだちにいいます。せんせいやクラスには「よろしくおねがいします」といいましょう。
    textVi: Câu "yoroshiku" chỉ nói với bạn bè. Với giáo viên và cả lớp, hãy nói "yoroshiku onegaishimasu" nhé.
    textEn: "\"Yoroshiku\" on its own is only for friends. With the teacher and the class, say \"yoroshiku onegaishimasu\"."
    textRomaji: Yoroshiku wa tomodachi ni iimasu. Sensei ya kurasu ni wa "yoroshiku onegaishimasu" to iimashou.
    textEnglishIpa:
    animationCue: talk
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    targetItemId:
    targetNpcId:
    targetAreaId:
